	"Show every finished pod (Completed)": "Mostrar todos los pods terminados (Completed)",
	"Many finished pods (%d)": "Muchos pods terminados (%d)",
	"%d pods in %s already finished (Completed). It's normal that they stay: Kubernetes only garbage-collects finished pods when the whole cluster has more than 12,500 (kube-controller-manager --terminated-pod-gc-threshold). They use no CPU or memory, but they clutter kubectl and the API and slow down tools.": "%d pods de %s ya terminaron (Completed). Es normal que se queden: Kubernetes solo recoge pods terminados cuando el cluster entero supera los 12.500 (kube-controller-manager --terminated-pod-gc-threshold). No usan CPU ni memoria, pero ensucian kubectl y la API y hacen lentas las herramientas.",
	"They come from Argo Workflows: Argo keeps the pod of every step while its Workflow exists, unless podGC or a TTL is configured.": "Vienen de Argo Workflows: Argo guarda el pod de cada paso mientras exista su Workflow, salvo que configures podGC o un TTL.",
	"Argo, for every workflow: in the workflow-controller-configmap set workflowDefaults.spec.podGC.strategy: OnPodSuccess (deletes each step's pod when it succeeds; failed ones stay for debugging) and ttlStrategy.secondsAfterCompletion: 86400 (deletes finished workflows after a day).": "Argo, para todos los workflows: en el workflow-controller-configmap pon workflowDefaults.spec.podGC.strategy: OnPodSuccess (borra el pod de cada paso cuando termina bien; los fallidos se quedan para depurar) y ttlStrategy.secondsAfterCompletion: 86400 (borra los workflows terminados tras un día).",
	"Or per workflow template: spec.podGC.strategy: OnPodCompletion / OnWorkflowSuccess.": "O por plantilla de workflow: spec.podGC.strategy: OnPodCompletion / OnWorkflowSuccess.",
	"Want to keep the history? Enable the Argo workflow archive (a database) and let the pods go.": "¿Quieres conservar el historial? Activa el archivo de workflows de Argo (una base de datos) y deja ir los pods.",
